<title>USA: ESC Medical hair removal system gets FDA approval.</title>
<headline>ESC Medical hair removal system gets FDA approval.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESC Medical Systems Ltd said Tuesday it received U.S. Food and Drug Administration clearance to market its EpiLight hair removal system in the U.S.</p>
<p>The Israel-based company said EpiLight is a device based on its proprietary intense pulsed light technology.</p>
